  "solution": "Given equation: (54 ÷ 18) × 5 + 9 × 2 – 45 + 12 × 3 = 57\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c512c74e463691385e7faa512876f64d01a83a38d891e664c32eb73cc4e17b96.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) Interchange 18 and 9**\n\nGiven equation becomes:\n\n(__**54 ÷ 9**__) × 5 + 18 × 2 – 45 + 12 × 3 = 57\n\n⇒ __**6 × 5**__ + __**18 × 2**__ – 45 + __**12 × 3**__ = 57\n\n⇒ __**30 + 36**__ – 45 + 36 = 57\n\n⇒ __**66 – 45**__ + 36 = 57\n\n⇒ __**21 + 36**__ = 57\n\n⇒ **57 = 57**\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nThis option makes the equation correct.\n\n**Option 2) Interchange 2 and 5**\n\nGiven equation becomes:\n\n(__**54 ÷ 18**__) × 2 + 9 × 5 – 45 + 12 × 3 = 57\n\n⇒ __**3 × 2**__ + __**9 × 5**__ – 45 + __**12 × 3**__ = 57\n\n⇒ __**6 + 45**__ – 45 + 36 = 57\n\n⇒ __**51 – 45**__ + 36 = 57\n\n⇒ __**6 + 36**__ = 57\n\n⇒ 42 ≠ 57\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) Interchange 5 and 3**\n\nGiven equation becomes:\n\n(__**54 ÷ 18**__) × 3 + 9 × 2 – 45 + 12 × 5 = 57\n\n⇒ __**3 × 3**__ + __**9 × 2**__ – 45 + __**12 × 5**__ = 57\n\n⇒ __**9 + 18**__ – 45 + 60 = 57\n\n⇒ __**27 – 45**__ + 60 = 57\n\n⇒ __**-18 + 60**__ = 57\n\n⇒ 42 ≠ 57\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) Interchange 9 and 12**\n\nGiven equation becomes:\n\n(__**54 ÷ 18**__) × 5 + 12 × 2 – 45 + 9 × 3 = 57\n\n⇒ __**3 × 5**__ + __**12 × 2**__ – 45 + __**9 × 3**__ = 57\n\n⇒ __**15 + 24**__ – 45 + 27 = 57\n\n⇒ __**39 – 45**__ + 27 = 57\n\n⇒ __**-6 + 27**__ = 57\n\n⇒ 21 ≠ 57\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
